2.1.3.1 straight.el
...................

     (use-package eve
       :straight (:type git :host github :repo "behaghel/eve.el"
                  :files (:defaults
                          ("scripts" "scripts/run-cli.sh")
                          ("cli/dist" "cli/dist/*.whl")
                          ("docs" "docs/eve.info" "docs/dir"))))

   The explicit file groups are required: straight's defaults select
Elisp files but do not preserve these runtime and manual subdirectories.
The launcher must remain at ‘scripts/run-cli.sh’, the wheel under
‘cli/dist/’, and the compiled manual under ‘docs/’.  Do not include a
development ‘cli/.venv’ or unrelated benchmark scripts.  After changing
an existing recipe, run ‘M-x straight-rebuild-package RET eve RET’ to
refresh its file selection.


