**************

This manual focuses on using Eve.

   For contributor setup, local commands, CI parity, and documentation
generation, see CONTRIBUTING.md (../CONTRIBUTING.md).

   The combined local test command is:

     devenv shell -- test-all

   If you are editing this manual itself, regenerate the Info output
with:

     devenv shell -- docs


